  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds DockerSiteDefinition: static web sites (Angular and other SPA builds, or any dist folder) served by an nginx container on the same environment network as the application, with declared proxy routes, SPA history fallback and generated runtime-config files. Sites publish their address into WebConfigStore<SiteConfig>, so browser timelines resolve them by identifier like every other resource.\nBREAKING - RunningApi gained a NetworkBaseUrl parameter after BaseUrl, and application containers now carry the network alias 'api-<identifier>' so sites can proxy to them. Requires TestFramework.Web 0.4.0.",
